Use this section if you are setting up FOSSBilling for the first time, comparing installation methods, or preparing a development environment.

If you are installing FOSSBilling for production, start with [Requirements](/getting-started/requirements/), then follow [Standard Installation](/getting-started/installation/). Use [Docker Installation](/getting-started/docker/) if you prefer a containerized setup. Use [Building from Source](/getting-started/building/) when you are developing, contributing, or preparing custom packages.

